  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/4209AA">Definition <span data-tag="4209AA">2.3.1.3</span>.</a>correspondence!between $\infty $-categories Let $\calC $ and $\calC '$ be $\infty $-categories. A <em>correspondence</em> from $\calC $ to $\calC '$ is a $\infty $-category $\calM $ equipped with a map $F: \calM \rightarrow \Delta ^1$ and identifications $\calC \simeq F^{-1} \{ 0\} $, $\calC ' \simeq F^{-1} \{ 1\} $. </p>
